{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56319","headline":"答姬寄诗 · 李主簿","name":"答姬寄诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶到扬州悔别家，亲知留滞不因花。\n尘侵宝镜虽相待，长短归时上面及瓜。\n（见《增修诗话总龟前集》卷二十三引《南部新书》。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷八百一李主簿姬诗小注亦）（引有此诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李主簿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}